{"id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification","title":"thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification","path":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions.md","line":56,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions.tex#thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification","uses":["[[references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker]]","[[references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection]]","[[references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line]]","[[references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ06_LongTimeBehavior#prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity]]","[[references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ06_LongTimeBehavior#thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions.tex","label":"thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification","line":123,"source":"\\begin{theorem} [classification of ancient two-dimensional kappa-solutions]\n  \\label{thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification}\n  \\source{cao-zhu}\n  \\dcref{Theorem 6.2.2}\n  \\group{Asymptotic Shrinking Solitons}\n\nThe only nonflat ancient $\\kappa$-solutions to Ricci flow on\ntwo-dimensional manifolds are the round sphere $\\mathbb{S}^2$ and\nthe round real projective plane $\\mathbb{R}\\mathbb{P}^2$.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker, lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection, prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line, prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity, thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence}\n\\sketch The asymptotic shrinker has bounded curvature and is compact;\notherwise point selection and splitting give a forbidden nonflat limit.\nIt is therefore round, and the compact-flow convergence result identifies\nthe original solution \\cite{Ha95F, P2}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section> [classification of ancient two-dimensional kappa-solutions] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a637a2d74776f2d64696d656e73696f6e616c2d616e6369656e742d6b617070612d636c617373696669636174696f6e\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">cao-zhu</span></span> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. Theorem 6.2.2</span></span>\\group Asymptotic Shrinking Solitons <p></p>The only nonflat ancient <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\kappa $\">$\\kappa $</span>-solutions to Ricci flow on two-dimensional manifolds are the round sphere <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathbb {S}^2$\">$\\mathbb {S}^2$</span> and the round real projective plane <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathbb {R}\\mathbb {P}^2$\">$\\mathbb {R}\\mathbb {P}^2$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FCaoZhu%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCZ07_AncientKappaSolutions%23thm%3Acz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker\">↗ thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FCaoZhu%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCZ07_AncientKappaSolutions%23lem%3Acz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection\">↗ lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FCaoZhu%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCZ07_AncientKappaSolutions%23prop%3Acz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line\">↗ prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FCaoZhu%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCZ06_LongTimeBehavior%23prop%3Acz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity\">↗ prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FCaoZhu%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCZ06_LongTimeBehavior%23thm%3Acz-positive-euler-surface-convergence\">↗ thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence</a> \\sketch The asymptotic shrinker has bounded curvature and is compact; otherwise point selection and splitting give a forbidden nonflat limit. It is therefore round, and the compact-flow convergence result identifies the original solution <span class=\"reference\">\\cite{Ha95F, P2}</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group、sketch"]},"previous":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker","next":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#lem:cz-ancient-solution-asymptotic-volume-ratio-zero","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker","title":"thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker","label":"thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection","title":"lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection","label":"lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line","title":"prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line","label":"prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ06_LongTimeBehavior#prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity","title":"prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity","label":"prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ06_LongTimeBehavior#thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence","title":"thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence","label":"thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#lem:cz-ancient-solution-asymptotic-volume-ratio-zero","title":"lem:cz-ancient-solution-asymptotic-volume-ratio-zero","label":"lem:cz-ancient-solution-asymptotic-volume-ratio-zero"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#lem:cz-three-dimensional-shrinking-soliton-classification","title":"lem:cz-three-dimensional-shrinking-soliton-classification","label":"lem:cz-three-dimensional-shrinking-soliton-classification"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#cor:cz-ancient-kappa-solution-compactness","title":"cor:cz-ancient-kappa-solution-compactness","label":"cor:cz-ancient-kappa-solution-compactness"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#cor:cz-noncompact-ancient-cap-neck-structure","title":"cor:cz-noncompact-ancient-cap-neck-structure","label":"cor:cz-noncompact-ancient-cap-neck-structure"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-ancient-kappa-canonical-neighborhoods","title":"thm:cz-ancient-kappa-canonical-neighborhoods","label":"thm:cz-ancient-kappa-canonical-neighborhoods"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification","title":"thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification","tex":"\\begin{theorem} [classification of ancient two-dimensional kappa-solutions]\n  \\label{thm:cz-two-dimensional-ancient-kappa-classification}\n  \\source{cao-zhu}\n  \\dcref{Theorem 6.2.2}\n  \\group{Asymptotic Shrinking Solitons}\n\nThe only nonflat ancient $\\kappa$-solutions to Ricci flow on\ntwo-dimensional manifolds are the round sphere $\\mathbb{S}^2$ and\nthe round real projective plane $\\mathbb{R}\\mathbb{P}^2$.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker, lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection, prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line, prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity, thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence}\n\\sketch The asymptotic shrinker has bounded curvature and is compact;\notherwise point selection and splitting give a forbidden nonflat limit.\nIt is therefore round, and the compact-flow convergence result identifies\nthe original solution \\cite{Ha95F, P2}.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker","title":"thm:cz-ancient-kappa-asymptotic-shrinker","description":""},{"node":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection","title":"lem:cz-unbounded-curvature-point-selection","description":""},{"node":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ07_AncientKappaSolutions#prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line","title":"prop:cz-pointed-limit-at-infinity-splits-line","description":""},{"node":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ06_LongTimeBehavior#prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity","title":"prop:cz-compact-shrinking-surface-soliton-rigidity","description":""},{"node":"references/CaoZhu/blueprint/src/chapters/CZ06_LongTimeBehavior#thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence","title":"thm:cz-positive-euler-surface-convergence","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}